    "text": "https://app.asana.com/1/1203355867603831/profile/1213560162044187 \nThe IE team has requested to upgrade the T4 template's AMP carousel component version from amp-carousel-0.1.js to amp-carousel-0.2.js.\nAction Required:\n    Please check the technical feasibility of upgrading the AMP Carousel version.\n    Since the T4 template is used by a large number of publishers, kindly evaluate any potential impact or compatibility concerns across existing implementations.\n    If feasible, please share the recommended approach and next steps\n    Please also highlight any potential risks or publisher-specific dependencies that need to be considered.\nSentiment is good here\nIf anything more is required from our end kindly let me know \ud83d\ude42",
